    "long_instructions": "In this level, you’ll assess your algorithm. AI's job is to critique your algorithm, not to write it for you.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Type in your algorithm’s pseudocode to start the conversation.\r\n- Use the AI chat to refine your algorithm. The AI will raise one critique at a time. Think carefully about each one.\r\n",
